{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Keeper</strong> \u2014 a psychological horror where light remains the only boundary between life and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>You take your shift as the lighthouse keeper on a remote island.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day follows a strict routine: keep order, maintain the machinery, watch the lighthouse flame and the foghorn. As long as the light burns, ships can find their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/c7f0911776d776c2f1b3c25e65f80bc0.poster.avif?t=1771833097\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/c7f0911776d776c2f1b3c25e65f80bc0.webm?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/c7f0911776d776c2f1b3c25e65f80bc0.mp4?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work and survival: clean the rooms, repair equipment, and gather food. The island does not forgive carelessness \u2014 survival depends solely on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/3f6d819dd6ffa09ccc0e7e921ec823fc.poster.avif?t=1771833097\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/3f6d819dd6ffa09ccc0e7e921ec823fc.webm?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/3f6d819dd6ffa09ccc0e7e921ec823fc.mp4?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive distress signals, answer ships\u2019 calls, and make decisions that determine their fate. Sometimes the radio carries more than it should\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/f6257892d1efe15351ca01fba67e7f82.poster.avif?t=1771833097\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/f6257892d1efe15351ca01fba67e7f82.webm?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/f6257892d1efe15351ca01fba67e7f82.mp4?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plot routes, mark dangerous zones, and guide vessels into a safe harbor. One mistake on the map can cost someone their life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/3a3a308b1f005986ae4f6420115ac501.poster.avif?t=1771833097\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/3a3a308b1f005986ae4f6420115ac501.webm?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/3a3a308b1f005986ae4f6420115ac501.mp4?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets of the island: explore abandoned structures, find traces of previous keepers, and gradually uncover the history of a place that does not want to be understood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/3aaba2f03312d7e7d0834fa9844faf03.poster.avif?t=1771833097\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/3aaba2f03312d7e7d0834fa9844faf03.webm?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/3aaba2f03312d7e7d0834fa9844faf03.mp4?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night is a trial: darkness creeps closer, the radio comes alive with strange voices, and your work must not stop for a single moment. Do not let the lighthouse go dark or the foghorn fall silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/d421cc08209b0bdc8315f980cd34089e.poster.avif?t=1771833097\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/d421cc08209b0bdc8315f980cd34089e.webm?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/extras/d421cc08209b0bdc8315f980cd34089e.mp4?t=1771833097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on real mysteries: inspired by maritime legends and literary works about the sea.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3005700?t=1771833097","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3005700?t=1771833097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/48b1ec04b7221240d2dd6713dcbc4e5d14f490e1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771833097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3005700/48b1ec04